			dependencies: ["1BC2251D58920B04"]
			description: [
				"硬得离谱，还怪辣的。闻起来像防护。还有饼干。主要是饼干。"
				""
				"&6Gingerbread Men will run up to any &4Candy Canes&f, &dGumball Piles&f, &7Sweet Teeth&f, Sundaes, &cCaramel Apples&f, Hot Chocolate Bottles, &dRadiant Essences&f, &bFrostmint&f, &eSundrops&f, &4Cakes&f, &6Pumpkin Pies&f, or &8Cookies&f &6on the ground and grab them. They will also chase down any players holding any of these candies in their inventory within a 20-block radius - upon reaching a player, they will take the candy from their inventory before running away for a minimum of 6 seconds. After stealing a rare candy, a Gingerbread Man will seek out any Gingerbarrels within a 32-block radius - upon reaching one, it will deposit the candy inside the Gingerbarrel. If 9 different rare candies are deposited into a Gingerbarrel by Gingerbread Men, they will convert into a random piece of Gingerbread armor&f."
			]
